{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614960/extras/782aa39691f8f7cb9b2efbadf56cf16e.avif?t=1750600972\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a contractor hired to perform routine maintenance in an abandoned hospital. What was supposed to be a simple job quickly turns into a desperate fight for survival. As you navigate the dark hallways, restoring power and unlocking doors, you uncover disturbing secrets hidden within the facility and its mysterious operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614960/extras/9a1bba32d3e3fb94cc5b09988ad40180.avif?t=1750600972\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich lore:</strong> Stories unfold through files, computer logs, old notes, and environmental storytelling, helping the player piece together this sinister mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frightening combat:</strong> The player is trapped inside a building with dangerous criminals who will eliminate anyone that threatens their operation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive graphics and soundscape</strong>:\u00a0Carefully crafted to imerse you in this dark abandoned environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614960/extras/bc9c9472502d539249871b821f54e5c1.avif?t=1750600972\" width=640 height=325 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"RUN!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3614960/218e5dcddfcc5f6aa05b206466f5a37d505920